    "task_description": "Self-supervised encoder-decoder GRU learns to restore shuffled frame order from dense optical flow of an effective zone; the restoration loss (DZL score) is used to classify CAD severity (SYNTAX score >= 23). A crowdsourced MTurk survey tests human sequence restoration on normal vs abnormal angiograms.",
    "clinical_application": "CAD severity assessment and PCI vs CABG decision support during coronary angiography"
  },
